# Inspiring Call counts "each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it": Bot1's two Botanical Brawlers (two counters
# each) are two cards, and only they gain indestructible until end of turn (CR 702.12b, 611.2c); Bot1's Ornithopter has no
# counter, and Bot2's Botanical Brawler has counters but is not Bot1's, so neither is counted or given it. Bot1's hand is
# empty before the spell, so the two Plains drawn show the count.

