Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Botanical Brawler
Botanical Brawler
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Inspiring Call
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Botanical Brawler
Island x17

